#### 2. Non-owner / forged sender metadata rejection ✅

| Attack Vector | Defense | Test |
|---|---|---|
| Non-owner sender ID | `currentSenderIsOwner` checks `configuredOwnerSenderIds()` ([L161-168](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/plugins/harness-bridge/index.js#L161-L168)); `"attacker"` is not in the set | [L389-397](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/tests/test_harness_bridge_plugin.mjs#L389-L397): `nonOwnerBrowserOpenRouting` → `undefined` |
| Forged sender in `Current user request:` body | `currentSenderId` parses only metadata **before** `"Current user request:"` marker ([L117-118](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/plugins/harness-bridge/index.js#L117-L118)); sender JSON inside the user text is ignored | [L398-407](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/tests/test_harness_bridge_plugin.mjs#L398-L407): `forgedSenderBrowserOpenRouting` → `undefined` |
| Forged context in `<conversation_context>` with free-form text | The JSON parser ([L120-127](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/plugins/harness-bridge/index.js#L120-L127)) requires structured `sender.id` in valid JSON at the start of conversation_context; free text like `"attacker said: ..."` won't parse as valid JSON → `undefined` | [L408-420](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/tests/test_harness_bridge_plugin.mjs#L408-L420): `forgedPriorContextBrowserOpenRouting` → `undefined` |
| Injected `"senderIsOwner":true` in prompt body | `currentSenderIsOwner` never reads `senderIsOwner` from the prompt; it only checks `sender.id` against the configured allow-list | [L293-302](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/tests/test_harness_bridge_plugin.mjs#L293-L302): `injectedOwnerNotionRouting` → `undefined` |
| Shared channel session key | `isOwnerOnlyDiscordSession` requires **all** channel users to be owners ([L156](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/plugins/harness-bridge/index.js#L156)); a channel with `["1158367139141521519", "attacker"]` is rejected | [L338-374](file:///Users/juntae.park/projects/harness-platform/tests/test_harness_bridge_plugin.mjs#L338-L374): `sharedChannelFollowup` → `undefined` |

